{"ok":true,"schema_version":"aster.response.v1","data":{"items":[{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/auth/feishu/start","summary":"开始飞书登录：返回授权地址，浏览器跳过去授权，10 分钟内有效。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"登录流程本身，此时调用方还没有身份"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/auth/feishu/callback","summary":"飞书授权回调：换取身份、建立浏览器会话，再跳回首页。只给浏览器用。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"登录流程本身，此时调用方还没有身份"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/auth/session","summary":"当前请求有没有登录、登录的是谁。没登录不报错，authenticated 为 false。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"问『我登录了吗』，未登录时要能得到 authenticated=false"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/auth/logout","summary":"注销当前浏览器会话。API 令牌不受影响，要让令牌失效请撤销它。","access":{"kind":"session_only","reason":"注销的是浏览器会话；令牌要失效请撤销它"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/auth/scopes","summary":"平台支持的 scope 及其含义。","access":{"kind":"authenticated","reason":"返回的是平台支持的 scope 清单本身，是一份静态词表，不含任何用户数据；要求某个 scope 才能读『有哪些 scope』会变成先有鸡还是先有蛋"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/auth/tokens","summary":"我签发过的全部 API 令牌，不含明文。","access":{"kind":"session_only","reason":"管理自己的令牌要有人在浏览器里操作。这里刻意不设 tokens:* scope——一个长期躺在磁盘上的令牌不该能列出或撤销别的令牌，而 scope 总数也要压在 4–5 个以内"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/auth/tokens","summary":"在浏览器里签发一个 CLI 用的 API token。","access":{"kind":"session_only","reason":"拿令牌签发令牌等于无限续期，还能顺手扩权"}},{"method":"PATCH","path":"/api/v1/auth/tokens/{token_id}","summary":"改一个还活着的 token：名字、权限、有效期。不重新签发、不返回明文。","access":{"kind":"session_only","reason":"能改自己权限的令牌能给自己扩权，能改自己有效期的令牌永不过期（不变量 22）","resource":{"kind":"api_token","param":"token_id","rule":"owner_only"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/auth/tokens/{token_id}","summary":"撤销一个 API 令牌，之后用它的请求立刻被拒。","access":{"kind":"session_only","reason":"管理自己的令牌要有人在浏览器里操作。这里刻意不设 tokens:* scope——一个长期躺在磁盘上的令牌不该能列出或撤销别的令牌，而 scope 总数也要压在 4–5 个以内","resource":{"kind":"api_token","param":"token_id","rule":"owner_only"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/credentials/models","summary":"我的全部模型配置，不含密钥明文。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:read","reason":"读取模型配置的**非秘密**摘要"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/credentials/models","summary":"新建一份模型配置。同一个人的配置名不能重复。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:write","reason":"新增、修改、删除模型配置"}},{"method":"PUT","path":"/api/v1/credentials/models/{model_id}","summary":"改一份模型配置。省略的字段保持原样，给了 headers 就整体替换。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:write","reason":"新增、修改、删除模型配置","resource":{"kind":"model_profile","param":"model_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/credentials/models/{model_id}","summary":"删掉一份模型配置。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:write","reason":"新增、修改、删除模型配置","resource":{"kind":"model_profile","param":"model_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/credentials/models/{model_id}/test-connection","summary":"对一份已保存的模型配置发一次最小请求，验证 Server 到它的连通性和鉴权。不改数据，结果不保存。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:read","reason":"读取模型配置的**非秘密**摘要","resource":{"kind":"model_profile","param":"model_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/credentials/git-tokens","summary":"我的 Git 令牌，不含令牌明文。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:read","reason":"读取模型配置的**非秘密**摘要"}},{"method":"PUT","path":"/api/v1/credentials/git-tokens/{host}","summary":"设置或更换一个托管平台的令牌。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:write","reason":"新增、修改、删除模型配置","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"路径里是托管平台名，不是记录 ID；按当前用户和平台取，查询带 owner_id"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/credentials/git-tokens/{host}","summary":"删掉一个托管平台的令牌。之后你发起的同步不带令牌访问这个平台。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:write","reason":"新增、修改、删除模型配置","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"路径里是托管平台名，不是记录 ID；按当前用户和平台取，查询带 owner_id"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/credentials/git-tokens/{host}/test","summary":"用已保存的令牌问一次平台的 API 限额，看令牌能不能用。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"credentials:read","reason":"读取模型配置的**非秘密**摘要","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"路径里是托管平台名，不是记录 ID；按当前用户和平台取，查询带 owner_id"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/runs/validate","summary":"提交前的预检：解析并冻结这一单，回一份展开规模的预演和一个短期令牌。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs","summary":"Run 列表。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/runs","summary":"提交一个 Run。先调 POST /runs/validate 拿验证令牌；同一个幂等键重复提交返回同一个 Run。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}","summary":"一个 Run 的详情：状态、计数和冻结配置。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"PATCH","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}","summary":"改一个 Run 的名称、并发上限、归档或优先级，给了哪个改哪个。并发上限 Worker 下一次领取就按新值，调低不打断在跑的 Rollout。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/events","summary":"一个 Run 的执行事件，按顺序给出；可以只看一个 Rollout。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/cancel","summary":"取消整个 Run。排队中的 Rollout 当场撤回，执行中的等 Worker 停下；cancel_pending 表示还有没停下的。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/samples/cancel","summary":"取消选中的 Rollout。排队中的当场撤回；执行中的由 Worker 在几秒内停下并回收沙箱。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/samples/rerun","summary":"在原 Run 里把选中的、已结束的 Rollout 再跑一次。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/submission","summary":"复制为新 Run 用的请求体：按这个 Run 现在的样子生成，改完再提交。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/flow","summary":"一个 Run 冻结的流程：来源、参数、前后时限和快照里的全部文件。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/attempts","summary":"一个 Run 的全部 attempt，按顺序给出，带重跑来源。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/attempts/{attempt_id}/logs/{stream}","summary":"一次 attempt 的一路日志，按字节偏移分段读。跑着的时候拿 next_offset 接着读，complete 为真后不会再变。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/samples","summary":"一个 Run 下的全部 Rollout。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/samples/{sample_id}","summary":"一个 Rollout 的详情，含合并后的完整冻结配置。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/artifacts","summary":"一个 Run 已提交的产物清单；可以只看一个 Rollout 或一次 attempt。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/artifacts/{attempt_id}/{path}","summary":"下载一份已提交的产物，响应头带字节摘要，用来校验完整性。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/archives/{attempt_id}","summary":"一次 attempt 的产物整包：对象存储里的位置、摘要和一个限时的直接下载链接。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"run","param":"run_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/quota","summary":"我还能提交多少、已经用了多少。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/materials","summary":"素材库里我这一份的一层目录。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"PUT","path":"/api/v1/materials","summary":"上传一棵素材树（请求体是 tar、tar.gz 或 zip 归档），整棵替换这个路径上已有的，不合并。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/materials","summary":"删掉一棵素材树。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/materials/tree","summary":"一棵素材树的摘要。提交 Run 时冻结的就是这里返回的 ``sha256``。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/flows/presets","summary":"列出平台流程模板。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/flows/presets/{preset_id}","summary":"获取可编辑的单文件模板。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"目录条目由部署自带，不属于任何用户"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/flows/render","summary":"将 Harbor 表单选择编译为 flow.py，不创建 Run。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/flows/render/image-build","summary":"将镜像构建表单编译为 flow.py，不创建 Run。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/flows/check","summary":"静态检查 flow.py 并核对脚手架版本；不执行用户代码、不存快照。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/storage","summary":"共享存储里一层目录的内容；带 q 时只给名字匹配的。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/storage/preview","summary":"文件开头的文本。JSONL 轨迹、日志、patch 在页面上直接看；二进制文件只给大小。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/storage/download","summary":"整份文件。几百 MB 的文件也是按块读出，不整份进内存。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/objects","summary":"桶里一层的内容：公共前缀当目录，前缀在前、各自按名字排。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/objects/link","summary":"一个对象的大小、修改时间和一个限时的直接下载链接。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/datasets","summary":"数据集列表：自己的全部，加上别人有已发布版本的，带各自的版本概况；给了 q 只列名字或 ID 里含它的。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/datasets","summary":"新建一个空数据集，名字不能和自己已有的重复。Task 靠建草稿、往草稿里加 Task 进来。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/datasets/{dataset_id}","summary":"一个数据集和它的版本，每个版本带基础版本和改动概况。别人的数据集只列已发布的版本。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"dataset","param":"dataset_id","rule":"owner_or_shared"}}},{"method":"PATCH","path":"/api/v1/datasets/{dataset_id}","summary":"改名和说明；省略的字段不改。已经提交的 Run 不受影响：它们记的是版本 ID。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset","param":"dataset_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/datasets/{dataset_id}","summary":"连同所有版本和版本树一起删。已经提交的 Run 不受影响：它们冻结的是展开后的值。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset","param":"dataset_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/datasets/{dataset_id}/versions","summary":"建一个草稿：从一个已发布版本复制 Task（连同镜像绑定和 Task 目录），或者从空的开始。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset","param":"dataset_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/tasks","summary":"往草稿里加 Task（请求体是 tar.gz 或 zip，一个或几个 Task）：同名的替换，内容没变的不动，新的追加。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/tasks","summary":"从草稿里删 Task，Harbor Task 连同它在版本树里的目录一起删。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/tasks","summary":"一个版本里的 Task，分页：挑 Task 和改草稿要看的字段，不带 instruction 和诊断（那些看版本详情）；带上版本摘要。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner_or_shared"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}","summary":"一个数据集版本：逐个 Task 的格式结论、镜像状态和相对基础版本的改动。已发布的版本谁都能看。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner_or_shared"}}},{"method":"DELETE","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}","summary":"删掉一个草稿和它的版本树。已发布的版本不能删。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"PUT","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/images","summary":"给一个 Task 的一个角色显式绑定镜像，优先于 Task 自己的声明。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/publish","summary":"发布：tag 解析成 digest 并读出 WORKDIR，记下素材摘要，之后版本不再可变。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/datasets/versions/{version_id}/export","summary":"导出版本树：一个 Task 一个目录，和上游数据集目录的形状一样。平台的索引和镜像绑定不混进去。已发布的版本谁都能导出。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"dataset_version","param":"version_id","rule":"owner_or_shared"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/images","summary":"按目录浏览镜像库里的仓库，或在一个目录下按名字搜，分页返回。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/images","summary":"推一个镜像进镜像库，请求体是 ``docker save`` 出来的 OCI 归档。推完才返回。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:write","reason":"提交、取消、重试 Run"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/images/{name}","summary":"一个镜像仓库的全部版本：tag、digest、平台和 WORKDIR。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"目录条目由部署自带，不属于任何用户"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/scaffolds","summary":"列出脚手架目录、仓库里已经同步的版本（从新到旧）和每家最近一次同步。新建 Run 选版本就看这里。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/scaffolds/syncs","summary":"最近 50 条同步，新排队的在前：排队的有前面还有几个，在跑的有各步进度，结束的有结果。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/scaffolds/syncs","summary":"排一个同步：查最新版，仓库里没有就连同它要的运行时一起下载进仓库，有就跳过。立刻返回这条同步（queued）。","access":{"kind":"admin","reason":"往共享的脚手架仓库里下载几百 MB，也决定了所有人能选哪些版本。"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/scaffolds/syncs/{sync_id}","summary":"一条同步的状态和各步进度：阶段、已下和总字节、速度、开始和结束时间。进度每秒更新一次。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"同步任务是部署共用的脚手架仓库上的操作，不属于点它的管理员"}}},{"method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/scaffolds/syncs/{sync_id}/cancel","summary":"取消一条同步，下了一半的会删掉。","access":{"kind":"admin","reason":"停掉别的管理员排的同步，下了一半的会删掉。","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"同步任务是部署共用的脚手架仓库上的操作，不属于点它的管理员"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/sdk/releases","summary":"列出登记过的 SDK 发布，新登记的在前，分页返回。","access":{"kind":"scope","scope":"runs:read","reason":"读取 Run、Rollout、事件与产物"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/health","summary":"Server 是否在运行，以及它的版本。不查数据库。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"健康检查，负载均衡要在没有凭证的情况下调"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/placements","summary":"本部署可选的放置组。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"部署固有的目录数据，不含任何用户数据"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/cli","summary":"这个部署能提供的 CLI。``aster update`` 用它判断要不要更新。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"装 CLI 的时候还没有 CLI，也就还没有令牌；内容是部署自带的二进制"}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/cli/download/{platform}","summary":"下载一个平台的 CLI 二进制，响应头带它的摘要。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"装 CLI 的时候还没有 CLI，也就还没有令牌；内容是部署自带的二进制","resource":{"kind":"none","reason":"平台名选的是部署自带的 CLI 构建，不属于任何用户"}}},{"method":"GET","path":"/api/v1/cli/install.sh","summary":"一行安装：``curl -fsSL http://aster.naiveai-dev.com/api/v1/cli/install.sh | sh``。","access":{"kind":"public","reason":"装 CLI 的时候还没有 CLI，也就还没有令牌；内容是部署自带的二进制"}}]},"meta":{"warnings":[]}}
